    "body": "Blocker fix: `clippy too_many_arguments` (8/7) at `crates/motion/src/drilling/tests_tilted.rs:16`.\n\nThe helper `tilted_wall` had eight parameters. It now takes one `TiltedWall` struct. No assertion of the pin changes.\n\nCommit on `issue/3554-tilted-hole-pin`: `79c7c909a` `test(motion): fold the tilted-hole helper into a parameter struct` (`Refs #3554`).\n\nReadings on `79c7c909a`:\n- `cargo clippy -j 3 -p camcraft-motion --all-targets -- -D warnings`: clean.\n- `tilted_wall_builder_at_zero_tilt_is_a_z_hole`: pass.\n- `tilted_holes_in_a_plate_are_not_drilled_along_z`: pass.\n- `a_tilt_the_fit_accepts_moves_no_wall_past_fit_tol`: pass.\n\nThe branch `issue/3554-tilted-hole-pin` on `NeoTech/Camcraft` is at `79c7c909a`. The fork head stays at `418e88034`, because this account cannot push to `mkinney/Camcraft`. The fix needs a push to the fork, or a new pull request from the `NeoTech/Camcraft` branch.\n",
